DESCRIPTION:[Ben McNally Books Social]\nJoin us for the November Social!\n
 As we head into the holiday season\, we wanted to take an opportunity to t
 alk about the books you're planning on giving to friends\, family\, or tho
 se unfamiliar acquantainces you're expecting to come into contact with.\nA
 s per usual\, Danielle and Rupert will run through a couple of books that 
 might be of interest. But\, building off the success and feedback on last 
 month\, we'd love to have you talk about a book\, too!\nJoin us for nibble
 s\, drinkies\, and some literary conversations
