DESCRIPTION:[BMB Book Club]\nContinuing on with our year of reading first 
 novels by established authors\, for November we'll be reading\nThe Orchard
  Keeper\nby Cormac McCarthy (known for\nNo Country for Old Men\, The Road\
 , Blood Meridian\n.)\nWe hope that you'll join us to talk about the book\,
  enjoy a cookie\, and get a bit of exclusive access to the store.\nThis wi
 ll be the last meeting of the year\, so join us to help us decide the them
 e for 2027!\nPlease note: you'll need to either buy a ticket to the meetin
 g or a copy of the book.
